Language School Management System
Overview
A lightweight and modular management system for a language school, built with Python, SQLAlchemy ORM, and SQLite.
The project handles student registration, course tracking (IELTS & Speaking), remaining sessions, reporting, login authentication, and backup of deleted records.

Architecture
The project follows a clean layered structure:

Models – SQLAlchemy ORM database tables

DAL (Data Access Layer) – Repository pattern for CRUD and queries

BL (Business Logic) – Application logic and validation

Main Application – Runs the system and connects layers together

This separation makes the project easy to maintain, extend, and scale.

Features
Add, update, delete, and search students

Track IELTS and Speaking sessions

Store remaining sessions

Backup deleted records

Login system with admin support

Reports by date and date range

Dynamic search and dynamic update

Automatic database creation

Run the Project
bash
pip install sqlalchemy
python main.py
Future Improvements
REST API using FastAPI

Desktop UI (PyQt / Tkinter)

Unit tests (pytest)

PDF/Excel report export

Role-based access control

Attendance tracking

Course scheduling and teacher assignment

